      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "5",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Run ye to and fro through the streets of Jerusalem, and see now, and know, and seek in the broad places thereof, if ye can find a man, if there be",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "any",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.5.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.5.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that executeth judgment, that seeketh the truth; and I will pardon it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And though they say, The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.5.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.5.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "liveth; surely they swear falsely.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.5.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.5.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ",",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.5.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.5.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not thine eyes upon the truth? thou hast stricken them, but they have not grieved; thou hast consumed them,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "but",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.5.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.5.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "they have refused to receive correction: they have made their faces harder than a rock; they have refused to return.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore I said, Surely these",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.5.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.5.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "poor; they are foolish: for they know not the way of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.5.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.5.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ",",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "nor",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.5.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.5.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the judgment of their God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will get me unto the great men, and will speak unto them; for they have known the way of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.5.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.5.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ",",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.5.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.5.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the judgment of their God: but these have altogether broken the yoke,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.5.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.5.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "burst the bonds.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wherefore a lion out of the forest shall slay them,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.5.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.5.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a wolf of the evenings shall spoil them, a leopard shall watch over their cities: every one that goeth out thence shall be torn in pieces: because their transgressions are many,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.5.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.5.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "their backslidings are increased.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ How shall I pardon thee for this? thy children have forsaken me, and sworn by",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "them that are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.5.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.5.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "no gods: when I had fed them to the full, they then committed adultery, and assembled themselves by troops in the harlots' houses.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They were",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "as",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.5.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.5.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "fed horses in the morning: every one neighed after his neighbour's wife.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shall I not visit for these",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "things",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.5.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.5.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "? saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.5.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.5.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ": and shall not my soul be avenged on such a nation as this?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Go ye up upon her walls, and destroy; but make not a full end: take away her battlements; for they",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.5.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.5.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD's",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.5.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.5.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For the house of Israel and the house of Judah have dealt very treacherously against me, saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.5.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.5.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They have belied the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.5.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.5.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and said,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "It is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.5.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.5.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not he; neither shall evil come upon us; neither shall we see sword nor famine:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the prophets shall become wind, and the word",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.5.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.5.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not in them: thus shall it be done unto them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wherefore thus saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.5.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.5.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God of hosts, Because ye speak this word, behold, I will make my words in thy mouth fire, and this people wood, and it shall devour them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lo, I will bring a nation upon you from far, O house of Israel, saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.5.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.5.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ": it",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.5.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.5.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a mighty nation, it",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.5.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.5.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "an ancient nation, a nation whose language thou knowest not, neither understandest what they say.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Their quiver",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.5.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.5.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "as an open sepulchre, they",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.5.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.5.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "all mighty men.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they shall eat up thine harvest, and thy bread,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "which",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.5.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.5.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thy sons and thy daughters should eat: they shall eat up thy flocks and thine herds: they shall eat up thy vines and thy fig trees: they shall impoverish thy fenced cities, wherein thou trustedst, with the sword.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nevertheless in those days, saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.5.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.5.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", I will not make a full end with you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
