    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ And it shall come to pass, when ye shall say, Wherefore doeth the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.5.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.5.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "our God all these",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "things",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.5.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.5.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "unto us? then shalt thou answer them, Like as ye have forsaken me, and served strange gods in your land, so shall ye serve strangers in a land",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.5.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.5.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not yours.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Declare this in the house of Jacob, and publish it in Judah, saying,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hear now this, O foolish people, and without understanding; which have eyes, and see not; which have ears, and hear not:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fear ye not me? saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.5.22",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.5.22"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ": will ye not tremble at my presence, which have placed the sand",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "for",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.5.22",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.5.22"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the bound of the sea by a perpetual decree, that it cannot pass it: and though the waves thereof toss themselves, yet can they not prevail; though they roar, yet can they not pass over it?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But this people hath a revolting and a rebellious heart; they are revolted and gone.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neither say they in their heart, Let us now fear the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.5.24",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.5.24"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "our God, that giveth rain, both the former and the latter, in his season: he reserveth unto us the appointed weeks of the harvest.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
