            {
              "text": "things",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.5.25",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.5.25"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and your sins have withholden good",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "things",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.5.25",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.5.25"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "from you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For among my people are found wicked",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "men:",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.5.26",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.5.26"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "they lay wait, as he that setteth snares; they set a trap, they catch men.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As a cage is full of birds, so",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.5.27",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.5.27"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "their houses full of deceit: therefore they are become great, and waxen rich.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They are waxen fat, they shine: yea, they overpass the deeds of the wicked: they judge not the cause, the cause of the fatherless, yet they prosper; and the right of the needy do they not judge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shall I not visit for these",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "things",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.5.29",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.5.29"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "? saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.5.29",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.5.29"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ": shall not my soul be avenged on such a nation as this?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
